~ vending_machine
# before Fiona's first card swipe, snacks she can't afford look normal (she doesn't know the reader is broken).
# once the swipe fails (vending_card_declined), they grey out.
What do you want to get from the vending machine?
- Cheddar cheese balls – $1.75 [repeatable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") >= 175]
	do Inventory.remove_amount("cash", 175)
	do Inventory.add_item("vending_cheese_balls")
	=> vending_bought
- Cheddar cheese balls – $1.75 [repeatable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") < 175 and Flags.get_level_flag("vending_card_declined") == false]
	=> vending_cant_pay
- Cheddar cheese balls – $1.75 [unavailable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") < 175 and Flags.get_level_flag("vending_card_declined") == true]
	=> vending_cant_pay
- Pink-pack protein bar – $3.25 [repeatable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") >= 325]
	do Inventory.remove_amount("cash", 325)
	do Inventory.add_item("vending_protein_bar")
	=> vending_bought
- Pink-pack protein bar – $3.25 [repeatable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") < 325 and Flags.get_level_flag("vending_card_declined") == false]
	=> vending_cant_pay
- Pink-pack protein bar – $3.25 [unavailable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") < 325 and Flags.get_level_flag("vending_card_declined") == true]
	=> vending_cant_pay
- Boba tea – $3.75 [repeatable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") >= 375]
	do Inventory.remove_amount("cash", 375)
	do Inventory.add_item("vending_boba_tea")
	=> vending_bought
- Boba tea – $3.75 [repeatable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") < 375 and Flags.get_level_flag("vending_card_declined") == false]
	=> vending_cant_pay
- Boba tea – $3.75 [unavailable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") < 375 and Flags.get_level_flag("vending_card_declined") == true]
	=> vending_cant_pay
- Diet cola – $2.25 [repeatable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") >= 225]
	do Inventory.remove_amount("cash", 225)
	do Inventory.add_item("vending_diet_cola")
	=> vending_bought
- Diet cola – $2.25 [repeatable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") < 225 and Flags.get_level_flag("vending_card_declined") == false]
	=> vending_cant_pay
- Diet cola – $2.25 [unavailable] [if Inventory.get_count("cash") < 225 and Flags.get_level_flag("vending_card_declined") == true]
	=> vending_cant_pay
- Nothing. Never mind. [Leave]
	=> END

~ vending_cant_pay
if Flags.get_level_flag("vending_card_declined") == false:
	You swipe your card through the card reader.
	# step 2.397: the reader's error beep (the keypad's wrong-code beep)
	do SoundManager.play_sfx("incorrect_beep")
	Vending Machine Screen: CARD READER OUT OF SERVICE. PLEASE USE CASH.
	do Flags.set_level_flag("vending_card_declined", true)
	Player: (Oh, shoot. And I'm out of cash for that.)
else
	Player: (I'm out of cash for that.)
=> END

